  "rationale": "The batch shows weak predictions for proper nouns after comma-terminated introductory phrases and after “with,” and for nouns following determiners or adjectives; the representative “The” → “needles” error has especially low probability. Add moderate, reusable context rules to the name roots for those two name-introducing contexts, and to several recurring noun roots after a determiner or adjective. This does not assume a particular name or noun is always correct, and leaves other continuations available. The diagnostic free generation is malformed, but this small patch addresses only patterns supported by the revealed batch, not the whole generation failure. Replay behavior remains unverified and should be checked by the gate.",
